.TH path_relative_to_sa 3
.SH NAME
path_relative_to_sa \- compute a relative path using stralloc inputs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "path.h"
.PP
.BI "int path_relative_to_sa(const stralloc *" path ", const stralloc *" relative_to ", stralloc *" out ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B path_relative_to_sa
is a version of
.BR path_relative_to (3)
that accepts
.I stralloc
pointers for the input path and base directory. It computes the relative path
from
.I relative_to
to
.I path
and appends the result to
.IR out .
Returns 1 on success, 0 otherwise.
.SH SEE ALSO
path_relative_to(3)